<style>
  @page {
    size: A4;
    margin: 0;
  }
  .page {
    width: 794px;
    height: 1123px;
    padding: 50px 60px;
    box-sizing: border-box;
    overflow: hidden;
    page-break-after: always;
    position: relative;
    font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Helvetica", Arial, sans-serif;
  }
  .page:last-child {
    page-break-after: auto;
  }
  /* Basic styling to mimic document structure */
  .header-section {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: flex-start;
    margin-bottom: 30px;
  }
  .form-body {
    line-height: 1.6;
  }
  .signature-line {
    margin-top: 60px;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
  }
  .input-field {
    border-bottom: 1px solid #000;
    min-width: 100px;
    display: inline-block;
  }
</style>

<div class="page">
  <div class="header-section">
    <div>
      University of Central Missouri<br>
      Office of Student Financial Services<br>
      P.O. Box 800<br>
      Warrensburg, MO
      <br><br>
      Phone: {{ contact_phone }}<br>
      FAX: {{ contact_fax }}<br>
      Website: {{ contact_website }}
    </div>
    <div>
      Marital Status<br>
      Adjustment Request
      <br><br>
      UCM use only
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="form-body">
    <p><strong>2021/2022 Award Year</strong></p>

    <div style="margin-top: 20px;">
      <label>MARPJ</label>
      <div style="margin-top: 10px;">
        <span class="input-field" style="width: 50px;">700</span>
        <span class="input-field" style="width: 50px;" data-field="marpj">{{ marpj }}</span>
        <span class="input-field" style="width: 50px;" data-field="marpj_2">{{ marpj_2 }}</span>
        <span class="input-field" style="width: 50px;" data-field="marpj_3">{{ marpj_3 }}</span>
        <span class="input-field" style="width: 50px;" data-field="marpj_4">{{ marpj_4 }}</span>
        <span class="input-field" style="width: 50px;" data-field="marpj_5">{{ marpj_5 }}</span>
        <span class="input-field" style="width: 50px;" data-field="field_1">{{ field_1 }}</span>
        <span class="input-field" style="width: 50px;" data-field="field_2">{{ field_2 }}</span>
      </div>
      <p style="margin-top: 10px;">UCM ID Number</p>
    </div>

    <p style="margin-top: 30px;">Student's Name (please print)</p>
    <div style="border-bottom: 1px solid #000; margin-bottom: 30px;" data-field="student_s_name">{{ student_s_name }}</div>

    <p>I have <span data-field="marital_status_description">{{ marital_status_description }}</span> since <span data-field="start_date">{{ start_date }}</span> Free Application for Federal Student Aid (FAFSA) was submitted, and I'm requesting that my eligibility for federal financial aid be <span data-field="recalculation_status">{{ recalculation_status }}</span>.</p>

    <p>
      <input type="checkbox" style="margin-right: 5px;"> I am submitting copies of the following documents with this request:
    </p>

    <ol style="margin-top: 15px;">
      <li>My legal <span data-field="document_type_1">{{ document_type_1 }}</span> (date of marriage must be prior to October 15, 2021).</li>
      <li>My <span data-field="document_type_2">{{ document_type_2 }}</span>.</li>
      <li>My spouse's <span data-field="document_type_3">{{ document_type_3 }}</span>.</li>
    </ol>

    <p style="margin-top: 25px; font-weight: bold; text-align: center;">
      FAILURE TO PROVIDE ALL INFORMATION AND REQUIRED DOCUMENTS<br>
      WILL DELAY THE RECALCULATION OF YOUR FINANCIAL AID.
    </p>

    <p style="margin-top: 30px;">Spouse's Full Name:</p>
    <div style="border-bottom: 1px solid #000; margin-bottom: 15px;" data-field="spouse_s_full_name">{{ spouse_s_full_name }}</div>

    <p>My spouse <input type="checkbox" style="margin-right: 5px;"> will <input type="checkbox" style="margin-right: 5px;"> not attend a college or university during the <span data-field="school_year">{{ school_year }}</span> school year. If he or she will attend, please provide the name of the school:</p>
    <div style="border-bottom: 1px solid #000; margin-bottom: 30px;" data-field="will">{{ will }}</div>

    <p>Do you have children of your own? If so, how many of your children will live with you and your spouse, and receive at least half their financial support from you and your spouse during the <span data-field="school_year_2">{{ school_year_2 }}</span> school year?</p>
    <div style="border-bottom: 1px solid #000; margin-bottom: 30px;" data-field="school_year_3">{{ school_year_3 }}</div>
    <p>Their names and ages are:</p>
    <div style="border-bottom: 1px solid #000; margin-bottom: 40px;" data-field="their_names_and_ages_are">{{ their_names_and_ages_are }}</div>

    <div class="signature-line">
      <div>
        Student's Signature
        <div style="border-bottom: 1px solid #000; margin-top: 50px;" data-field="their_names_and_ages_are_2">{{ their_names_and_ages_are_2 }}</div>
        Date
      </div>
      <div>
        Spouse's Signature
        <div style="border-bottom: 1px solid #000; margin-top: 50px;" data-field="date">{{ date }}</div>
        Date
      </div>
    </div>

    <div style="margin-top: 50px;">
      Local/Campus Address
      <div style="border-bottom: 1px solid #000; margin-bottom: 10px;" data-field="date_2">{{ date_2 }}</div>
      City
      <div style="border-bottom: 1px solid #000; display: inline-block; width: 150px; margin-right: 30px;" data-field="local_campus_address">{{ local_campus_address }}</div>
      State
      <div style="border-bottom: 1px solid #000; display: inline-block; width: 100px; margin-right: 30px;" data-field="city">{{ city }}</div>
      Zip
      <div style="border-bottom: 1px solid #000; display: inline-block; width: 100px; margin-right: 30px;" data-field="state">{{ state }}</div>
      Student's Telephone/Cell Number
      <div style="border-bottom: 1px solid #000; display: inline-block; width: 250px;" data-field="zip">{{ zip }}</div>
    </div>

    <div style="margin-top: 80px;">
      <p>Complete and submit this form and the documents indicated above to the UCM Office of Student Financial Services in person (1100 Ward Edwards Bldg.) or by mail (Student Financial Services, P.O. Box 800, Warrensburg MO 64093-5178), or by fax (660-543-8080).</p>
    </div>

    <div style="margin-top: 60px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between;">
      <button style="padding: 10px 20px; border: 1px solid #000; background-color: #f0f0f0;">Reset Form</button>
      <button style="padding: 10px 20px; border: 1px solid #000; background-color: #f0f0f0;">Print</button>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>